quotient as a *manifold-with-16-cone-singularities* object in-tree — Mathlib has no orbifold/singular
space type; this needs a project-local "smooth away from a finite set + standard cone chart at each"
carrier. Candidate reuse: `SingularSurgeryCharts` / `SingularSurgeryDatumC0`.

**K5 — the A₁ resolution model (single node): the Euler −2 disk bundle over S².**  (Open.)
Replace one cone-on-ℝP³ neighborhood by the total space of the disk bundle `D(𝒪(−2)) → S²` (Euler
